{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日熱傳一段車Cam片段，片段顯示，事發於日前晚上約6時22分，地點為啟德晴朗商場對開斑馬線。當時路面有不少行人正陸續過路，前方2部私家車及1輛電單車均十分守規矩，停在斑馬線前讓行人先行。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-11h03m15s715.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20264zJSKyzqCb1789528844.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-11h03m15s715.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">豈料尾隨一部掛着兩地牌的七人車，疑因等得不太耐煩，竟然切線逆線爬頭，強行駛過斑馬線。當時仍有途人正在橫過馬路，七人車直接在行人身邊擦身而過場面十分危險。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-11h03m05s266.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026NLfY1rho6i1789528838.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-16-11h03m05s266.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">不少人直斥涉事司機駕駛態度極度不負責任且缺乏耐心，紛紛留言大罵：「危險駕駛」、「前面啲車都要等啦，冇耐心，等吓都唔得」、「見到斑馬線仲照衝好離譜。」，更有網民表示：「呢啲一定唔可以放過」，要求相關部門深入調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T03:39:23.418415+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}